            "id": 23327,
            "title": "Champions League Final 2026 Budapest \u2014 FAQPage Schema (Post #23324)",
            "code": "\nif ( is_single( 23324 ) ) {\n    echo '<script type=\"application\/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"FAQPage\",\n  \"mainEntity\": [\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"When is the 2026 Champions League Final?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"The 2026 UEFA Champions League Final takes place on Saturday, May 30, 2026, with kick-off at 21:00 CET. The match will be held at the Pusk\u00e1s Arena in Budapest, Hungary.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Where is the 2026 Champions League Final being held?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"The final will be played at the Pusk\u00e1s Arena in Budapest, Hungary. The stadium has a capacity exceeding 67,000 and has previously hosted EURO 2020 matches, the 2020 UEFA Super Cup, and the 2023 Europa League Final.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Which teams are in the Champions League semi-finals 2026?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"The four semi-finalists are Paris Saint-Germain (defending champions), Bayern Munich, Atl\u00e9tico de Madrid, and Arsenal. The semi-final pairings are PSG vs Bayern Munich and Atl\u00e9tico de Madrid vs Arsenal.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"How do I get from Budapest Airport to the city center on Champions League Final weekend?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Budapest Ferenc Liszt International Airport (BUD) is approximately 20\u201325 minutes from the city center by road in normal traffic. On the Champions League Final weekend, traffic will be significantly heavier. Pre-booked group private transfers from VanBudapest.com provide the most reliable option, with meet-and-greet service, flight monitoring, and direct hotel transfers.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"What is the best way to get to Pusk\u00e1s Arena on match day?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"The Pusk\u00e1s Arena is served by the M2 metro line (Pusk\u00e1s Ferenc Stadion station). On-site parking is heavily restricted on match day. For groups, a pre-booked private transfer with designated drop-off and pick-up zones is the most efficient solution.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Can I book group transport for the entire Champions League Final week in Budapest?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Yes. VanBudapest.com offers multi-day group transport packages with vans, minibuses, and coaches \u2014 including airport transfers, match-day shuttles, sightseeing tours, and corporate event logistics. Since 1988, VanBudapest has specialized in premium private transportation for international events in Budapest.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Is there a fan zone for the Champions League Final in Budapest?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Yes. UEFA and the city of Budapest are organizing a multi-day Champions Festival around Heroes Square and City Park from May 28 to May 31, 2026. The festival includes free concerts, big-screen match viewings, sponsor zones, and interactive football experiences.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Who is performing at the Champions League Final 2026 Kick Off Show?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"The 2026 Champions League Final Kick Off Show will be headlined by The Killers, presented by Pepsi. The show takes place inside the Pusk\u00e1s Arena before the match.\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n<\/script>';\n}\n",
