            "title": "VanBudapest Fullwidth \u2014 Election 2026 (Post 23093)",
            "code": "\/* =====================================================\r\n   VANBUDAPEST.COM \u2014 FULLWIDTH OVERRIDE\r\n   CSAK Post ID 23093 \u2014 Hungary Election 2026 Guide\r\n   =====================================================\r\n   \r\n   HOVA: WPCode \u2192 New Snippet \u2192 CSS Snippet\r\n   TITLE: VanBudapest Fullwidth \u2014 Election 2026 (Post 23093)\r\n   \r\n   FONTOS: Minden szab\u00e1ly .postid-23093 prefix-szel kezd\u0151dik,\r\n   \u00edgy KIZ\u00c1R\u00d3LAG erre az egy bejegyz\u00e9sre hat.\r\n   M\u00e1s oldalakat NEM \u00e9rint.\r\n   ===================================================== *\/\r\n\r\n\r\n\/* === 1. BODY RESET \u2014 CSAK EZ A POST === *\/\r\nbody.postid-23093 {\r\n  margin: 0 !important;\r\n  padding: 0 !important;\r\n  overflow-x: hidden !important;\r\n}\r\n\r\nbody.postid-23093.has-global-padding {\r\n  padding-left: 0 !important;\r\n  padding-right: 0 !important;\r\n}\r\n\r\n\r\n\/* === 2. WORDPRESS WRAPPER OVERRIDES \u2014 CSAK EZ A POST === *\/\r\nbody.postid-23093 .entry-content,\r\nbody.postid-23093 .wp-site-blocks,\r\nbody.postid-23093 .wp-block-group,\r\nbody.postid-23093 .site-content,\r\nbody.postid-23093 .site-main,\r\nbody.postid-23093 .wp-block-post-content {\r\n  max-width: 100% !important;\r\n  width: 100% !important;\r\n  padding-left: 0 !important;\r\n  padding-right: 0 !important;\r\n  margin-left: 0 !important;\r\n  margin-right: 0 !important;\r\n  overflow: visible !important;\r\n}\r\n\r\n\r\n\/* === 3. BLOCK EDITOR CONSTRAINTS \u2014 CSAK EZ A POST === *\/\r\nbody.postid-23093 .is-layout-constrained > .alignfull,\r\nbody.postid-23093 .is-layout-constrained > .vb-fw,\r\nbody.postid-23093 .is-layout-constrained > .vb-section,\r\nbody.postid-23093 .wp-block-group.alignfull,\r\nbody.postid-23093 .wp-block-group.has-global-padding {\r\n  max-width: 100% !important;\r\n  width: 100% !important;\r\n  margin-left: 0 !important;\r\n  margin-right: 0 !important;\r\n}\r\n\r\n\r\n\/* === 4. FULL-WIDTH SECTION \u2014 DESKTOP (\u2265769px) \u2014 CSAK EZ A POST === *\/\r\n@media (min-width: 769px) {\r\n  body.postid-23093 .vb-section.vb-fw {\r\n    width: 100vw !important;\r\n    max-width: 100vw !important;\r\n    margin-left: calc(50% - 50vw) !important;\r\n    margin-right: calc(50% - 50vw) !important;\r\n    position: relative !important;\r\n    left: 50% !important;\r\n    right: 50% !important;\r\n    transform: translateX(-50%) !important;\r\n    overflow: visible !important;\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n\r\n\r\n\/* === 5. FULL-WIDTH SECTION \u2014 MOBILE (\u2264768px) \u2014 CSAK EZ A POST === *\/\r\n@media (max-width: 768px) {\r\n  body.postid-23093 .vb-section.vb-fw {\r\n    width: 100% !important;\r\n    max-width: 100% !important;\r\n    margin-left: 0 !important;\r\n    margin-right: 0 !important;\r\n    padding-left: 0 !important;\r\n    padding-right: 0 !important;\r\n    position: static !important;\r\n    left: auto !important;\r\n    right: auto !important;\r\n    transform: none !important;\r\n    overflow: visible !important;\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n\r\n\r\n\/* === 6. INNER CONTAINER \u2014 CSAK EZ A POST === *\/\r\n@media (min-width: 769px) {\r\n  body.postid-23093 .vb-section .vb-container {\r\n    max-width: 1320px !important;\r\n    margin: 0 auto !important;\r\n    padding: 80px 24px !important;\r\n    overflow: visible !important;\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n\r\n@media (max-width: 768px) {\r\n  body.postid-23093 .vb-section .vb-container {\r\n    padding: 40px 16px !important;\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n\r\n\r\n\/* === 7. CUSTOM HTML BLOCK RESET \u2014 CSAK EZ A POST === *\/\r\nbody.postid-23093 .wp-block-html {\r\n  max-width: 100% !important;\r\n  width: 100% !important;\r\n  padding: 0 !important;\r\n  margin: 0 !important;\r\n  overflow: visible !important;\r\n}\r\n\r\n\r\n\/* === 8. ENTRY CONTENT FULL-WIDTH BREAKOUT \u2014 CSAK EZ A POST === *\/\r\nbody.postid-23093 .entry-content > * {\r\n  max-width: 100% !important;\r\n}\r\n\r\n@media (min-width: 769px) {\r\n  body.postid-23093 .entry-content > .vb-election-article,\r\n  body.postid-23093 .entry-content > article {\r\n    max-width: 100vw !important;\r\n    width: 100vw !important;\r\n    margin-left: calc(50% - 50vw) !important;\r\n    margin-right: calc(50% - 50vw) !important;\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n\r\n@media (max-width: 768px) {\r\n  body.postid-23093 .entry-content > .vb-election-article,\r\n  body.postid-23093 .entry-content > article {\r\n    max-width: 100% !important;\r\n    width: 100% !important;\r\n    margin-left: 0 !important;\r\n    margin-right: 0 !important;\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n\r\n\r\n\/* === 9. ARTICLE LAYOUT OVERFLOW \u2014 CSAK EZ A POST === *\/\r\nbody.postid-23093 .vb-article-layout {\r\n  overflow: visible !important;\r\n}\r\n\r\n\r\n\/* === 10. SPECIFIKUS FULL-WIDTH ELEMEK \u2014 CSAK EZ A POST === *\/\r\nbody.postid-23093 .vb-hero-election,\r\nbody.postid-23093 .vb-image-band,\r\nbody.postid-23093 .vb-fleet-showcase,\r\nbody.postid-23093 .vb-cta-election {\r\n  overflow: visible !important;\r\n}",
