            "title": "VanBudapest Custom Footer v2.0",
            "code": "<!-- \u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\r\n     VANBUDAPEST.COM \u2014 CUSTOM FOOTER v2.0 (FIXED)\r\n     WordPress \/ Organic Chrono compatible\r\n     Insert via: WPCode \u2192 Site Wide Footer\r\n     cache-bust: 2026-02-17T23:00:00Z\r\n     \u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550 -->\r\n\r\n<!-- Google Fonts for Footer -->\r\n<link href=\"https:\/\/fonts.googleapis.com\/css2?family=Playfair+Display:wght@400;700&family=Montserrat:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Open+Sans:wght@400;500;600&family=Poppins:wght@500;600;700&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\r\n\r\n<!-- Hide default theme footer -->\r\n<style>\r\n  .site-footer,\r\n  footer.wp-block-template-part,\r\n  footer:not(.vb-footer) {\r\n    display: none !important;\r\n  }\r\n<\/style>\r\n\r\n<style>\r\n\/* \u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\r\n   VanBudapest Footer v2.0\r\n   Design System: Navy + Gold + Cream\r\n   \u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550 *\/\r\n\r\n\/* Reset & Variables *\/\r\n.vb-footer,\r\n.vb-footer *,\r\n.vb-footer *::before,\r\n.vb-footer *::after {\r\n  margin: 0;\r\n  padding: 0;\r\n  box-sizing: border-box;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.vb-footer {\r\n  --vb-navy: #0A1F44;\r\n  --vb-navy-light: #12306A;\r\n  --vb-navy-dark: #050E23;\r\n  --vb-navy-mid: #0D2952;\r\n  --vb-gold: #C8B560;\r\n  --vb-gold-dark: #B78D38;\r\n  --vb-gold-light: #E5D9A8;\r\n  --vb-white: #FFFFFF;\r\n  --vb-cream: #F5F0E8;\r\n  --vb-gray-text: #8A9BBF;\r\n  --vb-gray-muted: #5A6D8F;\r\n  --vb-divider: rgba(200, 181, 96, 0.15);\r\n  --vb-font-display: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif;\r\n  --vb-font-heading: 'Montserrat', system-ui, sans-serif;\r\n  --vb-font-body: 'Open Sans', Arial, sans-serif;\r\n  --vb-font-cta: 'Poppins', system-ui, sans-serif;\r\n\r\n  \/* Full-width override for WordPress *\/\r\n  width: 100vw !important;\r\n  position: relative !important;\r\n  left: 50% !important;\r\n  right: 50% !important;\r\n  margin-left: -50vw !important;\r\n  margin-right: -50vw !important;\r\n  max-width: none !important;\r\n  overflow: visible !important;\r\n\r\n  font-family: var(--vb-font-body);\r\n  background: var(--vb-navy-dark);\r\n  color: var(--vb-white);\r\n  line-height: 1.6;\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/* Subtle texture overlay *\/\r\n.vb-footer::before {\r\n  content: '';\r\n  position: absolute;\r\n  top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;\r\n  background:\r\n    radial-gradient(ellipse at 20% 50%, rgba(200,181,96,0.03) 0%, transparent 50%),\r\n    radial-gradient(ellipse at 80% 20%, rgba(18,48,106,0.15) 0%, transparent 50%);\r\n  pointer-events: none;\r\n  z-index: 0;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.vb-footer > * {\r\n  position: relative;\r\n  z-index: 1;\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/* \u2500\u2500 BRAND BAR \u2500\u2500 *\/\r\n.vb-footer-brand {\r\n  padding: 40px 0 32px;\r\n  text-align: center;\r\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--vb-divider);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.vb-footer-brand-inner {\r\n  max-width: 1280px;\r\n  margin: 0 auto;\r\n  padding: 0 32px;\r\n  display: flex;\r\n  align-items: center;\r\n  justify-content: space-between;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.vb-footer-logo-area {\r\n  display: flex;\r\n  align-items: center;\r\n  gap: 16px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.vb-footer-logo {\r\n  display: flex;\r\n  align-items: center;\r\n  gap: 12px;\r\n  text-decoration: none;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.vb-logo-img {\r\n  width: 52px;\r\n  height: 52px;\r\n  object-fit: contain;\r\n  border-radius: 6px;\r\n  flex-shrink: 0;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.vb-logo-text {\r\n  display: flex;\r\n  flex-direction: column;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.vb-logo-text .vb-brand-name {\r\n  font-family: var(--vb-font-display);\r\n  font-size: 22px;\r\n  font-weight: 700;\r\n  color: var(--vb-white);\r\n  letter-spacing: 0.5px;\r\n  line-height: 1.1;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.vb-logo-text .vb-tagline {\r\n  font-family: var(--vb-font-heading);\r\n  font-size: 11px;\r\n  font-weight: 500;\r\n  color: var(--vb-gold);\r\n  letter-spacing: 2px;\r\n  text-transform: uppercase;\r\n  margin-top: 2px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.vb-footer-brand-cta {\r\n  display: flex;\r\n  align-items: center;\r\n  gap: 12px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.vb-btn-book {\r\n  display: inline-flex;\r\n  align-items: center;\r\n  gap: 8px;\r\n  padding: 14px 32px;\r\n  background: var(--vb-gold);\r\n  color: var(--vb-navy-dark);\r\n  font-family: var(--vb-font-cta);\r\n  font-size: 13px;\r\n  font-weight: 700;\r\n  text-transform: uppercase;\r\n  letter-spacing: 1.5px;\r\n  text-decoration: none;\r\n  border-radius: 50px;\r\n  transition: all 0.3s ease;\r\n  border: 2px solid var(--vb-gold);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.vb-btn-book:hover {\r\n  background: var(--vb-gold-dark);\r\n  border-color: var(--vb-gold-dark);\r\n  transform: translateY(-2px);\r\n  box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(200, 181, 96, 0.3);\r\n  color: var(--vb-navy-dark);\r\n  text-decoration: none;\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/* \u2500\u2500 MAIN GRID \u2500\u2500 *\/\r\n.vb-footer-main {\r\n  max-width: 1280px;\r\n  margin: 0 auto;\r\n  padding: 48px 32px;\r\n  display: grid;\r\n  grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 1fr 1fr 1.3fr;\r\n  gap: 48px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.vb-footer-col h4 {\r\n  font-family: var(--vb-font-heading);\r\n  font-size: 12px;\r\n  font-weight: 700;\r\n  text-transform: uppercase;\r\n  letter-spacing: 2.5px;\r\n  color: var(--vb-gold);\r\n  margin-bottom: 20px;\r\n  position: relative;\r\n  padding-bottom: 12px;\r\n  text-align: left;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.vb-footer-col h4::after {\r\n  content: '';\r\n  position: absolute;\r\n  bottom: 0; left: 0;\r\n  width: 24px;\r\n  height: 2px;\r\n  background: var(--vb-gold);\r\n  border-radius: 1px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.vb-footer-col ul {\r\n  list-style: none;\r\n  padding: 0;\r\n  margin: 0;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.vb-footer-col ul li {\r\n  margin-bottom: 10px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.vb-footer-col ul li a {\r\n  font-family: var(--vb-font-body);\r\n  font-size: 14px;\r\n  color: var(--vb-gray-text);\r\n  text-decoration: none;\r\n  transition: all 0.25s ease;\r\n  display: inline-flex;\r\n  align-items: center;\r\n  gap: 6px;\r\n  line-height: 1.5;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.vb-footer-col ul li a:hover {\r\n  color: var(--vb-white);\r\n  transform: translateX(3px);\r\n  text-decoration: none;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.vb-footer-col ul li a .vb-arrow {\r\n  opacity: 0;\r\n  transition: opacity 0.25s ease;\r\n  font-size: 10px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.vb-footer-col ul li a:hover .vb-arrow {\r\n  opacity: 1;\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/* Contact column *\/\r\n.vb-footer-contact-item {\r\n  display: flex;\r\n  align-items: flex-start;\r\n  gap: 12px;\r\n  margin-bottom: 16px;\r\n  text-decoration: none;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.vb-footer-contact-icon {\r\n  width: 36px;\r\n  height: 36px;\r\n  background: rgba(200, 181, 96, 0.08);\r\n  border: 1px solid rgba(200, 181, 96, 0.15);\r\n  border-radius: 8px;\r\n  display: flex;\r\n  align-items: center;\r\n  justify-content: center;\r\n  font-size: 15px;\r\n  flex-shrink: 0;\r\n  transition: all 0.3s ease;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.vb-footer-contact-item:hover .vb-footer-contact-icon {\r\n  background: rgba(200, 181, 96, 0.15);\r\n  border-color: var(--vb-gold);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.vb-footer-contact-label {\r\n  font-family: var(--vb-font-heading);\r\n  font-size: 10px;\r\n  font-weight: 600;\r\n  text-transform: uppercase;\r\n  letter-spacing: 1.5px;\r\n  color: var(--vb-gray-muted);\r\n  margin-bottom: 2px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.vb-footer-contact-value {\r\n  font-family: var(--vb-font-body);\r\n  font-size: 15px;\r\n  color: var(--vb-white);\r\n  font-weight: 500;\r\n  transition: color 0.25s ease;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.vb-footer-contact-item:hover .vb-footer-contact-value {\r\n  color: var(--vb-gold);\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/* \u2500\u2500 TRUST BADGES \u2500\u2500 *\/\r\n.vb-footer-badges {\r\n  border-top: 1px solid var(--vb-divider);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.vb-footer-badges-inner {\r\n  max-width: 1280px;\r\n  margin: 0 auto;\r\n  padding: 20px 32px;\r\n  display: grid;\r\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);\r\n  gap: 16px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.vb-badge {\r\n  display: inline-flex;\r\n  align-items: center;\r\n  justify-content: center;\r\n  gap: 8px;\r\n  padding: 8px 16px;\r\n  background: rgba(45, 95, 79, 0.1);\r\n  border: 1px solid rgba(45, 95, 79, 0.2);\r\n  border-radius: 24px;\r\n  font-family: var(--vb-font-heading);\r\n  font-size: 11px;\r\n  font-weight: 600;\r\n  color: #7BC4A5;\r\n  letter-spacing: 0.3px;\r\n  white-space: nowrap;\r\n  transition: all 0.3s ease;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.vb-badge:hover {\r\n  background: rgba(45, 95, 79, 0.18);\r\n  border-color: rgba(45, 95, 79, 0.35);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.vb-badge-dot {\r\n  width: 6px;\r\n  height: 6px;\r\n  background: #7BC4A5;\r\n  border-radius: 50%;\r\n  flex-shrink: 0;\r\n  animation: vb-pulse-dot 2s ease-in-out infinite;\r\n}\r\n\r\n@keyframes vb-pulse-dot {\r\n  0%, 100% { opacity: 1; }\r\n  50% { opacity: 0.4; }\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/* \u2500\u2500 TRUST & SOCIAL BAR \u2500\u2500 *\/\r\n.vb-footer-trust {\r\n  border-top: 1px solid var(--vb-divider);\r\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--vb-divider);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.vb-footer-trust-inner {\r\n  max-width: 1280px;\r\n  margin: 0 auto;\r\n  padding: 24px 32px;\r\n  display: flex;\r\n  align-items: center;\r\n  justify-content: space-between;\r\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\r\n  gap: 20px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/* Google Reviews *\/\r\n.vb-footer-reviews {\r\n  display: flex;\r\n  align-items: center;\r\n  gap: 10px;\r\n  text-decoration: none;\r\n  transition: opacity 0.3s ease;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.vb-footer-reviews:hover {\r\n  opacity: 0.85;\r\n  text-decoration: none;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.vb-footer-reviews .vb-stars {\r\n  display: flex;\r\n  gap: 2px;\r\n  color: #FBBF24;\r\n  font-size: 14px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.vb-footer-reviews .vb-review-text {\r\n  font-family: var(--vb-font-heading);\r\n  font-size: 12px;\r\n  font-weight: 600;\r\n  color: var(--vb-gray-text);\r\n  letter-spacing: 0.3px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.vb-footer-reviews .vb-review-text strong {\r\n  color: var(--vb-white);\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/* Social Icons *\/\r\n.vb-footer-social {\r\n  display: flex;\r\n  align-items: center;\r\n  gap: 10px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.vb-footer-social a {\r\n  width: 40px;\r\n  height: 40px;\r\n  border-radius: 10px;\r\n  border: 1px solid rgba(200, 181, 96, 0.15);\r\n  background: rgba(200, 181, 96, 0.04);\r\n  display: flex;\r\n  align-items: center;\r\n  justify-content: center;\r\n  text-decoration: none;\r\n  transition: all 0.3s ease;\r\n  position: relative;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.vb-footer-social a:hover {\r\n  border-color: var(--vb-gold);\r\n  background: rgba(200, 181, 96, 0.1);\r\n  transform: translateY(-2px);\r\n  text-decoration: none;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.vb-footer-social a svg {\r\n  width: 18px;\r\n  height: 18px;\r\n  fill: var(--vb-gray-text);\r\n  transition: fill 0.3s ease;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.vb-footer-social a:hover svg {\r\n  fill: var(--vb-gold);\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/* Planned icons *\/\r\n.vb-footer-social a.vb-planned {\r\n  opacity: 0.35;\r\n  cursor: default;\r\n  position: relative;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.vb-footer-social a.vb-planned::after {\r\n  content: 'COMING SOON';\r\n  position: absolute;\r\n  bottom: calc(100% + 8px);\r\n  left: 50%;\r\n  transform: translateX(-50%);\r\n  background: var(--vb-navy);\r\n  color: var(--vb-gold);\r\n  padding: 4px 10px;\r\n  border-radius: 4px;\r\n  font-family: var(--vb-font-heading);\r\n  font-size: 8px;\r\n  font-weight: 